<title>NETHERLANDS: RODAMCO RETAIL NED 96/97 NET UP 2.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>RODAMCO RETAIL NED 96/97 NET UP 2.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.43 vs   6.29 </p>
<p>    Net profit			    48.6  vs  47.4 </p>
<p>    Net rental income		   51.6  vs  45.5 </p>
<p>    Interest received		    2.5  vs   7.2</p>
<p>    Management fee			 5.5  vs   5.3 </p>
<p>NOTE - Property fund Rodamco Retail Nederland NV said it</p>
<p>expected 1997/98 earnings per share to rise by three percent to</p>
<p>just over 6.60 guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
